        "heading": "The Campaign",
        "text": "The campaign received widespread global media coverage and acclaim for its gripping communication and was further distributed on Times Square, digital billboards around New York, London and Paris as well as in cinemas. 81% of viewers said they recognize the importance of conscious shopping and the impact of fast fashion after watching the film, with a further 76% saying it made them think twice about the environmental impact of their clothing.",
